WEBVTT

00:02:58.191 --> 00:03:01.126
I have developed my own style
that I wear every day

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:02.872
and I don't vary from it.

00:03:02.896 --> 00:03:05.493
That has helped protect me
from endless discussion

00:03:05.517 --> 00:03:06.929
of my appearance.

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:10.025
It's helped me to get people
to listen to my words,

00:03:10.049 --> 00:03:11.564
not look at my clothes.

00:03:12.226 --> 00:03:14.552
JG: Hillary told us
she lost the equivalent

00:03:14.576 --> 00:03:18.808
of 24 full days of campaign time

00:03:18.832 --> 00:03:21.027
in the 2016 election

00:03:21.051 --> 00:03:23.987
getting her hair and makeup
done every day.

00:03:24.011 --> 00:03:28.049
But actually, contemporary problems
for women leaders go far deeper

00:03:28.073 --> 00:03:30.254
than anything to do with looks.